// glossary-data.js — reference entries for the ML/NN concepts and datasets
// this project actually uses.
//
// Every number quoted in a `formal` field was read out of the shipped
// checkpoints or the upstream source, not from the paper:
//
//   coarse.pth  335.9M params  20 layers, 20 heads, d=1280, 4 codebooks
//   c2f.pth     277.8M params  16 layers, 20 heads, d=1280, 14 codebooks (4 cond.)
//   codec.pth   150.2M params  44.1 kHz, 14 x 1024 codebooks, hop 768
//
// Entry shape: { id, term, symbol, category, formal, eli5, seeAlso }
//   formal  — technical definition, always visible
//   eli5    — plain-language version, collapsed by default
//   seeAlso — ids of related entries; validated by test/glossary.test.mjs

